{
    "title": "Plants vs. Zombies\u2122 Heroes",
    "description": "Plants vs. Zombies Heroes brings to you an epic CCG adventure with your favorite plant and zombie characters. \ud83c\udf31\ud83e\udddf Collect cards with incredible powers and build your ultimate battle deck. Duel with friends or foes in real-time pvp battles. And, for the first time ever on mobile, play as either plants or zombies. \r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddb8 COLLECT HERO CARDS \ud83e\uddb8\r\n\r\nCollect unique Plant and Zombie Hero cards and unlock their lawn-inspiring superpowers. Will you pick Plants and deploy the sharp-shooting avenger card, Green Shadow? Or will you choose a Zombie Hero and call on the superbly superficial card, Super Brainz? Each card\u2019s selection of powers will determine the strength of your deck and your team\u2019s winning strategy in real-time duels. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc7 BUILD YOUR DECK \ud83d\udcc7\r\n\r\nEvery Hero needs a crew. Build your deck and diversify your skills by collecting your favorite PvZ cards. There are hundreds to discover! Devise distinct strategies for your Hero by selecting compatible cards and experiment with devastating combos. Or use Auto Team-Builder to quickly create your deck, try out new strategies, and automatically upgrade your teams as you collect new cards.\r\n\r\n\u2694\ufe0f MASTER PVP DUELS \u2694\ufe0f\r\n\r\nTest your deck when you take on other players in exciting real-time pvp card battles. Earn rewards for defeating your bite-iest adversaries and build your bank when you complete Daily Missions from Crazy Dave. Who will become the ultimate horticultural hero? Harvest your courage \u2013 the duel is on, so put on your battle hats and jump in!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udff0 GO ON COURAGEOUS ADVENTURES \ud83c\udff0\r\n\r\nJourney through the universe of PvZ Heroes as each action-packed battle takes you further along an ever-blooming map. Duel with brain-thirsty or botanical foes \u2013 each side has a different path to follow. Encounter challenging bosses with tricky powers and defeat them for legendary rewards!\r\n\r\nSo, what are you waiting for? Jump into the arena, duel with other PvZ Heroes fans and become a master of this PvP card battle game today!\r\n\r\nImportant Consumer Information: Requires acceptance of EA\u2019s Privacy & Cookie Policy and User Agreement. Collects data through third party analytics technology (see Privacy & Cookie Policy for details). Contains direct links to the Internet and social networking sites intended for an audience over 13.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Plants vs. Zombies Heroes brings to you an epic CCG adventure with your favorite plant and zombie characters. \ud83c\udf31\ud83e\udddf Collect cards with incredible powers and build your ultimate battle deck. Duel with friends or foes in real-time pvp battles. And, for the first time ever on mobile, play as either plants or zombies. <br><br>\ud83e\uddb8 COLLECT HERO CARDS \ud83e\uddb8<br><br>Collect unique Plant and Zombie Hero cards and unlock their lawn-inspiring superpowers. Will you pick Plants and deploy the sharp-shooting avenger card, Green Shadow? Or will you choose a Zombie Hero and call on the superbly superficial card, Super Brainz? Each card\u2019s selection of powers will determine the strength of your deck and your team\u2019s winning strategy in real-time duels. <br><br>\ud83d\udcc7 BUILD YOUR DECK \ud83d\udcc7<br><br>Every Hero needs a crew. Build your deck and diversify your skills by collecting your favorite PvZ cards. There are hundreds to discover! Devise distinct strategies for your Hero by selecting compatible cards and experiment with devastating combos. Or use Auto Team-Builder to quickly create your deck, try out new strategies, and automatically upgrade your teams as you collect new cards.<br><br>\u2694\ufe0f MASTER PVP DUELS \u2694\ufe0f<br><br>Test your deck when you take on other players in exciting real-time pvp card battles. Earn rewards for defeating your bite-iest adversaries and build your bank when you complete Daily Missions from Crazy Dave. Who will become the ultimate horticultural hero? Harvest your courage \u2013 the duel is on, so put on your battle hats and jump in!<br><br>\ud83c\udff0 GO ON COURAGEOUS ADVENTURES \ud83c\udff0<br><br>Journey through the universe of PvZ Heroes as each action-packed battle takes you further along an ever-blooming map. Duel with brain-thirsty or botanical foes \u2013 each side has a different path to follow. Encounter challenging bosses with tricky powers and defeat them for legendary rewards!<br><br>So, what are you waiting for? Jump into the arena, duel with other PvZ Heroes fans and become a master of this PvP card battle game today!<br><br>Important Consumer Information: Requires acceptance of EA\u2019s Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy and User Agreement. Collects data through third party analytics technology (see Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy for details). Contains direct links to the Internet and social networking sites intended for an audience over 13.",
